 112+ 816C              ; routine called when player collides with a skull
 113+ 816C              ; it
 114+ 816C              ;   reduces health value and shows result
 115+ 816C              ;   on zero health, falls into lost life and shows result
 116+ 816C              ;===========================================================
 117+ 816C              takeDamage:
