 447  954C             >; simple 16-bit divide without the CALL/RET overhead
 447  954C CB 3C       >        srl h                                       ; divide by 2
 447  954E CB 1D       >        rr l
 447  9550 CB 3C       >        srl h                                       ; divide by 4
 447  9552 CB 1D       >        rr l
